.Python
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.env
data/state.json
data/capability_registry.json
# The interactive prompt history (core/input_handler.py).  It records what the
# user typed at the permission gate, so a pasted credential lands in it — it is
# runtime state, not source, and it must never be committed.
data/cli_history
# The context boundary (core/context_manager.py): the chunk id where the
# active conversation starts.  It is per-machine state — "/session new" moves
# it forward — so it belongs with state.json, not in the repository.
data/context_session.json
# Google OAuth refresh tokens for the Gmail/Calendar/Drive plugins.  A refresh
# token is a long-lived credential for the user's whole mailbox — it must never
# end up in a commit.
data/google_tokens*
data/google_pending_auth.json
# Oversized tool results are spilled to disk instead of being pushed into the
# context window (core/spill.py).  They are session artefacts, not source.
data/spill/
docs/active_plan.md
upgrade_roadmap.md
reasoning_tmp*
*tmp*
whatsapp_log.jsonl
Termux-WP*
.wwebjs*
# Notebook checkpoints — an editor artifact, never source.
.ipynb_checkpoints/
